title: "Incident Response Readiness Score (IRRS) Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Abid"
    given-names: "Muntathar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MAbidResearch/IRRS"
url: "https://github.com/MAbidResearch/IRRS"
abstract: >-
  The Incident Response Readiness Score (IRRS) Toolkit provides
  scenario-based assessment resources, evaluator scoring rubrics,
  scenario weighting guides, scoring templates, and human-centred
  telemetry instruments for assessing organisational incident
  response readiness.
keywords:
  - incident response
  - cybersecurity
  - readiness assessment
  - IRRS
  - decision latency
  - communication entropy
  - authority drift
